<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-020" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered" source-id="s-nanqishu-020-current-rendered-huiduan">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="q46_fom_xor_AA">明敬劉皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="q46_fom_xor_AA">惠端</persName>，彭城人，光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="q46_fom_xor">道弘</persName>孫也。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="47p_kjh_ez7">太祖</persName>為<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="z5d_9zy_u5h_B">高宗</persName>納之。建元三年，除西昌侯夫人。永明七年，卒，葬江乘縣張山。延興元年，贈宣城王妃。<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0006" ref="z5d_9zy_u5h_B">高宗</persName>即位，追尊為敬皇后。贈父通直郎<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0007" ref="q46_fom_xor_A">景猷</persName>金紫光祿大夫，母<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0008" ref="gyq_f8f_zbq">王氏</persName>平陽鄉君。永泰元年，<persName id="c-nanqishu-020-huiduan-rendered:p001:m0009" ref="z5d_9zy_u5h_B">高宗</persName>崩，改葬，祔于興安陵。</p>
</text>
